{"sections":[{"slug":"单子性函子","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"单子性函子"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子性函子</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"单子性函子"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">许多</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数结构</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可理解为某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的代数</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这种结构构成的范畴到基础范畴有一个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自由-遗忘伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">遗忘函子</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">我们称这个函子为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">单子性函子</span></strong> (monadic functor).</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G \\colon \\mathcal D \\to \\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为函子</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">若有</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单子</span>"}},{"Plain":" $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">等价于遗忘函子</span> $\\mathsf{Alg}_A(\\mathcal C) \\to \\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称之为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">单子性函子</span></strong>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">单子性函子</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">有左</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/伴随","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">伴随</span>"}},{"Plain":" $F$, <span lang=\"zh\">即单子</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">自由代数</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $X\\mapsto AX$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. $G\\colon \\mathcal D\\to\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">为单子性函子当且仅当</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">保守</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">且创生</span> $G$-<span lang=\"zh\">分裂</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/单纯对象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">单纯对象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/几何实现","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">几何实现</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一个出人意料的例子</span>: <span lang=\"zh\">紧</span> Hausdorff <span lang=\"zh\">空间的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{CHaus}$ <span lang=\"zh\">在集合范畴</span> $\\mathsf{Set}$ <span lang=\"zh\">上是单子性的</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">自反子范畴</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/自反子范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">自反子范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的嵌入</span> $\\mathcal D\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">是单子性的</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">下降</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">许多</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/下降","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">下降</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">现象表述为单子性</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}